{"id":"vod_sn_36581","vodId":"36581","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"空之境界","name_cn":"空之境界","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第13集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/1218ffb25cccb7f8c578ae7b87a41d2d.jpg"},"summary":"1998年夏季，拥有预测型未来视的女孩濑尾静音（井口裕香 配音）邂逅伽蓝之堂的黑桐干也（铃村健一 配音）。从对方口中，她了解到未来视的真相，心中的疑惑和焦虑也烟消云散，但同时也看到了干也悲剧性的未来。另一方面，拥有测定型未来视的职业炸弹狂魔仓密目琉夏，利用自己构建的未来制造一系列恐怖袭击事件，直到他遭遇冷静干练的两仪式（坂本真绫 配音），命运的齿轮开始转动。转眼来到2010年，失去了未来视能力的瓶仓光瑠（石田彰 配音）转行做了绘本画家，命运安排他和两仪式及其女儿未那（金元寿子 配音）相逢，此后他和崇拜自己的未那拜访了传奇占卜师观布子之母……本片根据奈须蘑菇以及武内崇创作的同名原作改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:44:24","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/f4Nzi3fveC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EusugUZ89s1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MC2eniH8VL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/z2TMfMB0aE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7Vfx6qnqP51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rdkaT6aVtJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8GBh1b8xXP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/M1aQUQb7fp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BWvJxF1H1C1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CtZFGKusV61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/17tkP9wWjg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kiSuZAig791/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UJJCBQLxRM1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:21.362Z"}